<h3><u>Abbas tere jaane ke baad</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>Haaye<br />
Qafela dasht e bala se jo sue shaam chala<br />
laash e abbas e alamdar pe zainab ne kaha<br />
abbas, abbas</p>

<p>Chin gai sar se rida, koi baaqi na raha<br />
abbas tere jane ke baad..(5)</p>

<p>1. Tane deta hai mujhe dekh ke yu shimr laee<br />
teri awaaz pe abbas tera aata nahi<br />
ban gai farshe azaa tere liye ab ye zamee<br />
shaam jana hi pada, ye sitam tujh pe hua<br />
abbas tere jane ke baad..(3)</p>

<p>2. Roke kulsoom teri yaad me karti hai buka<br />
teri haibat se kabhi soye nahi ehle jafa<br />
kaisi badli ye tere baad zamane ki hawa<br />
khush hue ehle sitam, so nahi paaye jo hum<br />
abbas tere jane ke baad..(3)</p>

<p>3. Raah me aale payambar ka dilasa mai bani<br />
shaam ke log tamashai tamasha mai bani<br />
zakhm sadaat ne paye to maseeha mai bani<br />
mai hi salaar bani mai alamdaar bani<br />
abbas tere jane ke baad..(3)</p>

<p>4. Haaye darbar me aulad e nabi aa pohchi<br />
aur sakina ko kanizi me bulata hai shaki<br />
kisse faryad karu tu hi bata mere akhi<br />
aur kya hoga sitam kitne lachaar hai hum<br />
abbas tere jane ke baad..(3)</p>

<p>5. Naam lekar jo sitamgar ne bulaya mujhko<br />
amma fizza ne pase pusht chupaya mujhko<br />
yu bhi pardes me ada ne sataya mujhko<br />
aise aalam me bhala, kisko deti mai sada<br />
abbas tere jane ke baad..(3)</p>

<p>6. Hind zindaan me aai to ye kohraam utha<br />
meri barbadi ka jab hind ne ehwaal suna<br />
apna sar peet ke wo karne lagi wa waila<br />
dekh kaisa hai sitam, qaid hai ehle haram<br />
abbas tere jane ke baad..(3)</p>

<p>7. Tauqo zanjeer se sajjad jo azaad hue<br />
qabr pe bali sakina ke gaye rote hue<br />
rukh sue karbobala karke yahi bain kiye<br />
seh nahi payi sitam, dukhtare shahe umam<br />
abbas tere jane ke baad..(3)</p>

<p>8. Shaam se mazhar o farhan rihai jo mili<br />
aaye maqtal me salami ke liye sab qaidi<br />
ghutniyo chalte hue bhai ke marqad pe gai<br />
the ye zainab ke sukhan, mar gai kyu na bahen<br />
abbas tere jane ke baad..(3)</p>
</p>
